'''Ivanna Sakhno''' (born [[November 14]], [[1997]])<ref name="Tomatoes" /> is a Ukrainian<ref name="Ukraine" /> actress who portrays [[Shin Hati]] in the [[2023]] television series ''[[Star Wars: Ahsoka]]''.<ref name="Getty">{{Getty|url=thewaltdisneystudios/allaccess#!asset/6ctxczpc954jt9558mkmw2v|text=The Walt Disney Studios All Access - Ahsoka online trailer uhd r709f stills 230329.088204|date=2023-04-07}}</ref> She is best known for playing the cadet [[w:c:pacificrim:Viktoriya Malikova|Viktoriya Malikova]] in the science fiction film ''[[Wikipedia:Pacific Rim Uprising|Pacific Rim: Uprising]]'' and Nadejda in the action comedy ''[[Wikipedia:The Spy Who Dumped Me|The Spy Who Dumped Me]]''.<ref name="Tomatoes" />

